# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:2
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_ed66347d:

    # "The barracks were built into the north-eastern wall of the fort."
    "O quartel foi construído na parede nordeste do forte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:3
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_2c7f6a1f:

    # "Cold, moist air welcomed us into what seemed to be our living quarters from now on."
    "O ar frio e úmido nos recebeu no que parecia ser nosso alojamento a partir de agora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:4
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_3722f164:

    # "Recruits were trying on their new armor. Some just sat on their bunks, concerned."
    "Os recrutas estavam experimentando suas novas armaduras. Alguns apenas estavam sentados em seus beliches, preocupados."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:5
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_361bb228:

    # "As I was circling a particularly big guy adjusting straps on his armor, I found myself standing beside two empty bunks."
    "Enquanto eu circulava um cara particularmente grande ajustando as correias de sua armadura, me vi parado ao lado de dois beliches vazios."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:6
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_adffd1b9:

    # "I turned to face Markus."
    "Eu me virei para encarar Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:9
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_33d0a905:

    # MC "I guess these are as good as any."
    MC "Acho que estes são tão bons quanto qualquer outro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:10
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_8c386ccb:

    # MARKUS "You seriously think we get to pick?"
    MARKUS "Você realmente acha que podemos escolher?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:11
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_875938d3:

    # MC "Well, I don't see any of them ordering us around."
    MC "Bem, não vejo nenhum deles nos dando ordens."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:12
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_8095938a:

    # "With that, I waved towards a couple of guards at the far end of the room."
    "Com isso, acenei para alguns guardas no outro extremo da sala."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:13
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_53f458a8:

    # "Markus nodded."
    "Markus assentiu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:14
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_73fd8781:

    # MARKUS "Fair enough."
    MARKUS "Justo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:16
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_834c6edf:

    # "Wooden trunks Joakim mentioned were set beside each bed."
    "Os baús de madeira que Joakim mencionou estavam colocados ao lado de cada cama."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:17
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_f6bc5929:

    # "I opened mine and was greeted by predatory glint of a halfway-sheathed sword."
    "Abri o meu e fui recebido pelo brilho predatório de uma espada meio embainhada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:18
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_10c49309:

    # "Beneath it was a rather heavy set of leather armor."
    "Debaixo dela estava um conjunto bastante pesado de armadura de couro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:29
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_39e0278a:

    # "A short while later..."
    "Pouco tempo depois..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:38
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_c757ea9d:

    # "Markus stretched about and flexed his arms as I was fitting the sheath onto my belt."
    "Markus se espreguiçou e flexionou os braços enquanto eu encaixava a bainha no meu cinto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:39
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_790ea3fc:

    # MARKUS "It's very tight in my... private area."
    MARKUS "Está muito apertado na minha... área íntima."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:40
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_d01f552c:

    # MC "Mine's okay."
    MC "A minha está boa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:41
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_92f0967b:

    # MARKUS "Exactly."
    MARKUS "Exatamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:42
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_5a4a2f7e:

    # MC "Go to h~"
    MC "Vá para o i~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:43
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_82d486b0:

    # GUARD "Recruits!"
    GUARD "Recrutas!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:44
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_454e72d0:

    # "One of the guards shouted in a commanding tone, ceasing all activity in the barracks."
    "Um dos guardas gritou em um tom autoritário, cessando toda atividade no quartel."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:45
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_5cb164df:

    # GUARD "Get strapped and head out into the yard now! This is not a fashion contest!"
    GUARD "Preparem-se e vão para o pátio agora! Isto não é um desfile de moda!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:47
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_eda86dd2:

    # "I adjusted my sheath belt and nodded to Markus."
    "Ajustei meu cinto de bainha e acenei para Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:48
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_fc84574c:

    # MARKUS "Mission complete, I guess."
    MARKUS "Missão cumprida, acho."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:50
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_bcc804a7:

    # "We headed out to the yard along with other recruits."
    "Fomos para o pátio junto com outros recrutas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:51
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_32fab128:

    # "Being no more but a crowd of armed civilians, we now looked like we belonged to a single military unit, for what its worth."
    "Sendo nada mais que uma multidão de civis armados, agora parecíamos pertencer a uma única unidade militar, pelo que isso vale."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:62
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_45d8f227:

    # "Out on the yard the recruits gathered, talking and examining each other."
    "No pátio, os recrutas se reuniram, conversando e examinando uns aos outros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:63
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_1e31f202:

    # "I noticed that redhead from before walking past us."
    "Notei a ruiva de antes passando por nós."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:65
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_cc6c0c9a:

    # KIARA @ happy "Looking good, boys!"
    KIARA @ happy "Estão bonitos, rapazes!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:66
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_c91ac63e:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Yeah, you too, young lady!"
    MARKUS @ smile "É, você também, mocinha!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:67
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_33bad0b1:

    # "As she passed us, I stole another glance at that leather-clad beauty and asked Markus:"
    "Enquanto ela passava por nós, dei outra olhada naquela beldade de couro e perguntei ao Markus:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:69
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_30f15ad3:

    # MC "How's that private area of yours doing now, huh?"
    MC "Como está sua área íntima agora, hein?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:70
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_111c74c8:

    # MARKUS "You have no idea..."
    MARKUS "Você não tem ideia..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:77
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_5dfda96d:

    # "Suddenly, the doors flung open and a short man with a grey beard stormed through them."
    "De repente, as portas se escancararam e um homem baixo com barba grisalha irrompeu por elas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:78
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_8e289369:

    # "Stocky, he carried with him heavy armour covered in scratches and dirt that clanked with every movement."
    "Atarracado, ele carregava uma armadura pesada coberta de arranhões e sujeira que tilintava a cada movimento."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:79
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_0dc6b792:

    # "More impressive was the monumental axe slung over his back that looked sharp enough to cut glass and the edges of which were traced with enchanted blue lines, eerily incandescent."
    "Mais impressionante era o machado monumental pendurado em suas costas, que parecia afiado o bastante para cortar vidro e cujas bordas eram contornadas por linhas azuis encantadas, estranhamente incandescentes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:80
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_31b98a0f:

    # "He vaulted forward onto the wooden podium Joakim lectured us from and landed with surprising grace, wood creaking under his heavy boots."
    "Ele saltou para a frente sobre o pódio de madeira de onde Joakim nos dava aula e aterrissou com uma graça surpreendente, a madeira rangendo sob suas botas pesadas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:81
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_24a5c132:

    # "He glowered down at us as he scanned the crowd from right to left."
    "Ele nos encarou de cima com um olhar furioso enquanto examinava a multidão da direita para a esquerda."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:82
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_afebb2e4:

    # "We fell into an ominous silence as we waited for what he would say."
    "Ficamos em um silêncio sinistro, aguardando o que ele diria."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:83
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_b9d9c4d5:

    # "Finally, with a heavy sigh, he began:"
    "Finalmente, com um suspiro pesado, ele começou:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:85
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_1bf2dc79:

    # DUPREY "I am Captain Duprey, leader of the Second Scouts Division."
    DUPREY "Eu sou o Capitão Duprey, líder da Segunda Divisão de Batedores."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:86
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_0156ee5b:

    # DUPREY "It is a great honour to be called upon to serve with the Scouts. I trust that you understand what has been bestowed upon you."
    DUPREY "É uma grande honra ser convocado para servir com os Batedores. Acredito que vocês compreendem o que lhes foi concedido."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:87
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_48443525:

    # DUPREY "Many of you are pissing yourselves right now and probably have been since you found out you were joining these corps."
    DUPREY "Muitos de vocês estão se mijando agora e provavelmente estão desde que descobriram que se juntariam a este corpo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:88
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_6eecb82f:

    # DUPREY "You have probably spent these last few years learning all the proper terms, the fancy tactics and no doubt some very pretty footwork as a part of the basic combat training you all had received."
    DUPREY "Vocês provavelmente passaram esses últimos anos aprendendo todos os termos adequados, as táticas sofisticadas e, sem dúvida, um belo trabalho de pés como parte do treinamento básico de combate que todos receberam."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:89
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_6e19fe3e:

    # DUPREY "We are going to work you {i}hard{/i} to forget all that!"
    DUPREY "Nós vamos fazer vocês trabalharem {i}duro{/i} para esquecer tudo isso!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:91
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_077f216b:

    # CROWD "{i}*Confused murmurs*{/i}"
    CROWD "{i}*Murmúrios confusos*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:92
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_03077b09:

    # DUPREY "I am not interested in you showing me your majestic flying three-sixty spinning limp dicked thrust!"
    DUPREY "Não estou interessado em ver vocês mostrando seu majestoso golpe voador giratório de trezentos e sessenta graus com o pau mole!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:93
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_ecac7050:

    # DUPREY "You will learn practical things here. You will learn how to be dirty in the fight to level the field against {i}the Demorai{/i}."
    DUPREY "Vocês aprenderão coisas práticas aqui. Vocês aprenderão como serem sujos na luta para nivelar o campo contra {i}os Demorai{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:94
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_e9df6359:

    # DUPREY "You will learn how to kill, without mercy and without hesitation."
    DUPREY "Vocês aprenderão como matar, sem misericórdia e sem hesitação."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:95
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_45026bd0:

    # DUPREY "You will learn {i}to win.{/i}"
    DUPREY "Você aprenderá {i}a vencer.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:96
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_3d3a4c07:

    # "One of the men stepped forward nervously to raise his hand."
    "Um dos homens deu um passo à frente, nervoso, para levantar a mão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:98
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_d3da28fb:

    # RECRUIT "A-Aren’t we supposed to fight honourably though?"
    RECRUIT "M-Mas não deveríamos lutar honradamente?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:99
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_75f8880f:

    # DUPREY "... Come here."
    DUPREY "... Venha aqui."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:100
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_995efa62:

    # "The man looked around, unsure of what to do."
    "O homem olhou ao redor, sem saber o que fazer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:102
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_f3e4c30d:

    # DUPREY "I SAID COME HERE!"
    DUPREY "EU DISSE VENHA AQUI!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:103
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_9e1355c7:

    # "Some of the guards moved to shove the man out of the line, where he climbed hesitantly onto the stage with the Captain."
    "Alguns guardas se moveram para empurrar o homem para fora da fila, onde ele subiu hesitante no palco com o Capitão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:107
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_ffbf2113:

    # "Y-Yes, sir?"
    "S-Sim, senhor?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:108
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_8ac93488:

    # "Taking a small sword, the Captain threw it to the man’s feet."
    "Pegando uma pequena espada, o Capitão a jogou aos pés do homem."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:109
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_d682f5d8:

    # DUPREY "Strike me down."
    DUPREY "Derrube-me."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:110
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_15291902:

    # "The crowd was silent, the man looked at him bewildered."
    "A multidão estava em silêncio, o homem olhou para ele desconcertado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:112
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_967048d4:

    # RECRUIT "W-What?"
    RECRUIT "Q-O quê?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:113
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_0fca85b6:

    # DUPREY "Pick that sword up and strike me down, boy! That is an order."
    DUPREY "Pegue essa espada e me derrube, garoto! É uma ordem."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:114
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_3ce74784:

    # RECRUIT "... But I—"
    RECRUIT "... Mas eu—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:116
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_30606e01:

    # DUPREY "YOU FUCKING MAGGOT!"
    DUPREY "SEU VERME DE MERDA!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:117
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_635fa0f5:

    # DUPREY "DO AS YOU’RE TOLD OR I’LL FLAY YOU MYSELF AND HANG YOUR BODY FROM THE WALLS AS A WARNING TO ANYONE ELSE THAT CAN’T FOLLOW SIMPLE FUCKING ORDERS."
    DUPREY "FAÇA O QUE LHE FOI DITO OU EU MESMO VOU TE ESFOLAR E PENDURAR SEU CORPO NAS MURALHAS COMO AVISO PARA QUALQUER OUTRO QUE NÃO CONSIGA SEGUIR ORDENS SIMPLES DO CARALHO."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:118
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_84e18a54:

    # "Terrified, the man scurried to pick up the sword, trembling as he pointed it towards the Captain."
    "Aterrorizado, o homem correu para pegar a espada, tremendo enquanto a apontava para o Capitão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:119
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_c22cf657:

    # DUPREY "... Now, STRIKE ME!"
    DUPREY "... Agora, ME GOLPEIE!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:129
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_5b9f4532:

    # "The man cried out as he lunged forward to attack the Captain."
    "O homem gritou enquanto avançava para atacar o Capitão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:130
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_2ce3e37e:

    # "Side stepping the blade, the Captain locked in the man’s arms and the two wrestled vehemently over the sword."
    "Esquivando-se da lâmina, o Capitão travou os braços do homem e os dois lutaram veementemente pela espada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:140
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_b7d5ce0d:

    # "So fast it was almost a blur, the Captain shoved his head forward, violently headbutting the unsuspecting man."
    "Tão rápido que foi quase um borrão, o Capitão projetou a cabeça para frente, dando uma violenta cabeçada no homem desavisado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:141
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_b0a3df0b:

    # "His nose ruptured open; blood streamed down his face so forcefully that when he screamed it spattered over Duprey."
    "Seu nariz se rompeu; o sangue escorreu pelo rosto com tanta força que, quando ele gritou, respingou em Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:142
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_9cb326ef:

    # RECRUIT "You... You broke my nose!"
    RECRUIT "Você... Você quebrou meu nariz!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:143
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_5b4bc1f3:

    # DUPREY "MEDIC! Get this man to the ward."
    DUPREY "MÉDICO! Levem este homem para a enfermaria."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:145
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_6cac3d25:

