    "A multidão de recrutas seguiu o anão, arrastando os pés em direção à área de treinamento."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:165
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_a207265b:

    # "I turned around, and couldn't see Markus."
    "Eu me virei, e não consegui ver o Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:166
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_8a0f909c:

    # MC "(*Sigh* Okay, let's get this over with.)"
    MC "(*Suspiro* Certo, vamos acabar logo com isso.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:172
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_3f6bcf4c:

    # "Entering the training area, I navigated my way through a crowd of recruits until I saw Markus beside me."
    "Entrando na área de treinamento, abri caminho entre os recrutas até ver o Markus ao meu lado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:175
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_56bb8c5f:

    # MC "Markus?"
    MC "Marcos?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:176
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_9d535044:

    # MARKUS "Tried to find an escape route?"
    MARKUS "Tentou encontrar uma rota de fuga?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:177
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_cb29500d:

    # "A couple recruits glanced at us over their shoulders."
    "Alguns recrutas nos olharam por cima dos ombros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:178
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c92ce338:

    # MARKUS "Yeah, right... Let's enjoy the show now."
    MARKUS "É, claro... Vamos aproveitar o show agora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:179
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_1e426a5d:

    # DUPREY "Recruits, stand at attention!"
    DUPREY "Recrutas, sentido!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:185
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_2ea90ceb:

    # DUPREY "Let's see what we're working with here!"
    DUPREY "Vamos ver com o que estamos lidando aqui!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:186
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_e93c1e63:

    # "Duprey glared at us, evaluating the raw material he was about to begin his work on."
    "Duprey nos encarou, avaliando a matéria-prima com a qual estava prestes a começar a trabalhar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:187
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_31a8afcf:

    # DUPREY "For starters, give me twenty laps along these walls."
    DUPREY "Para começar, dê-me vinte voltas ao longo destas paredes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:189
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_7ba801cb:

    # "The next few hours were a flurry of footwork and drill manoeuvres."
    "As horas seguintes foram uma agitação de trabalho de pés e manobras de treino."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:190
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_01d01bfe:

    # "There was nothing performative about it, no crowds to admire the techniques, utterly practical evaluation of our physical abilities."
    "Não havia nada de performático nisso, nenhuma multidão para admirar as técnicas, uma avaliação totalmente prática de nossas habilidades físicas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:191
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_7d87a1d8:

    # "Finally, exhausted and covered from head to toe in mud and bruises, the Captain called out for us to cease and form orderly ranks."
    "Finalmente, exaustos e cobertos da cabeça aos pés de lama e hematomas, o Capitão ordenou que parássemos e formássemos fileiras ordenadas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:196
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_e25404d9:

    # DUPREY "Very good, all... Very good!"
    DUPREY "Muito bem, todos... Muito bem!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:201
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_60e2af20:

    # "As the Captain got off the podium, he wandered menacingly up and down the new, now exhausted recruits."
    "Quando o Capitão desceu do pódio, ele perambulou ameaçadoramente entre os novos recrutas, agora exaustos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:202
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_d376b29a:

    # "He finally stopped in front of the girl I had eyed up earlier."
    "Ele finalmente parou na frente da garota que eu tinha observado antes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:205
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_1c556712:

    # DUPREY "{i}You...{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}Você...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:208
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_cc3e7297:

    # KIARA @ scared "... M-Me, sir?"
    KIARA @ scared "... E-eu, senhor?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:209
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_e2274450:

    # DUPREY "Yes, fucking you! Who else did you think I was talking to?"
    DUPREY "Sim, porra, você! Quem mais você achou que eu estava falando?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:210
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_8510aacd:

    # KIARA @ scared "Yes, sir! Sorry, sir!"
    KIARA @ scared "Sim, senhor! Desculpe, senhor!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:211
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_22b0f868:

    # "Her voice was soft, but clearly northern as it had the heavy twang of the highland regions."
    "A voz dela era suave, mas claramente nortenha, pois tinha o forte sotaque das regiões montanhosas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:212
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_36fc92e8:

    # "The Captain stared at her for a few moments, allowing the distinctive accent to roll off her tongue before asking."
    "O Capitão encarou-a por alguns momentos, deixando o sotaque distinto fluir de sua língua antes de perguntar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:213
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_a56e8d40:

    # DUPREY "... And where are you from?"
    DUPREY "... E de onde você é?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:214
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_81aca2ab:

    # KIARA "Angmurus, sir!"
    KIARA "Angmurus, senhor!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:217
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_af0a4203:

    # DUPREY @ laugh "Angmurian, you say?"
    DUPREY @ laugh "Angmuriana, você diz?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:218
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_7affa54d:

    # "The Captain smirked."
    "O Capitão sorriu maliciosamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:220
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_428d8001:

    # DUPREY "Tell me, girl, is it true you all learn to master dual blades?"
    DUPREY "Diga-me, garota, é verdade que todos vocês aprendem a dominar lâminas duplas?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:221
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_ff8dbf7d:

    # KIARA "I... It is mostly for traditions sake, sir."
    KIARA "Eu... É principalmente por tradição, senhor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:222
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_d47b76c9:

    # DUPREY "I didn’t ask if it was fucking for tradition or not, I asked if it was true."
    DUPREY "Eu não perguntei se era para a porra da tradição ou não, perguntei se era verdade."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:223
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_af4591a0:

    # KIARA @ scared "Yes, sir!"
    KIARA @ scared "Sim, senhor!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:224
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_6db54c4e:

    # DUPREY "... So, you’re {i}not{/i} just here to suck cock and spread your legs for the men then?"
    DUPREY "... Então, você {i}não{/i} está aqui só para chupar pau e abrir as pernas para os homens então?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:225
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_982630ce:

    # "There was some laughter from the recruits as the girl’s face flooded crimson."
    "Houve algumas risadas dos recrutas enquanto o rosto da garota ficava vermelho."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:226
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_668423cc:

    # KIARA "... No, sir."
    KIARA "... Não, senhor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:227
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_d00fc9ce:

    # DUPREY "Well, then..."
    DUPREY "Bem, então..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:229
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_ff68c617:

    # "The Captain grabbed two wooden blades and threw them at her feet."
    "O Capitão pegou duas lâminas de madeira e as jogou aos pés dela."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:230
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_48ff44a2:

    # DUPREY "{i}Prove it.{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}Prove.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:231
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c4a4d598:

    # "The girl paused and waited for a moment as the Captain took out a wooden staff and stepped up onto the podium."
    "A garota parou e esperou por um momento enquanto o Capitão pegava um bastão de madeira e subia no pódio."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:232
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_edc25de0:

    # DUPREY "... Well, pick them up!"
    DUPREY "... Bem, pegue-as!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:234
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_9def15c8:

    # "The girl did as she was told."
    "A garota fez como lhe foi dito."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:235
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_efe2ae5e:

    # DUPREY "Now get your fat ass up here, girl. I don’t have all day!"
    DUPREY "Agora levante a sua bunda gorda aqui, garota. Eu não tenho o dia todo!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:236
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_877a9d86:

    # "There were some laughs again from a couple of the recruits."
    "Houve algumas risadas novamente de alguns dos recrutas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:237
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_62461244:

    # DUPREY @ angry "DID I SAY YOU COULD FUCKING LAUGH?"
    DUPREY @ angry "EU DISSE QUE VOCÊS PODIAM RIR, PORRA?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:238
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_a07d1a6f:

    # DUPREY "... Are you ready?"
    DUPREY "... Você está pronta?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:239
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_2f65ab47:

    # "The girl raised her blades hesitantly."
    "A garota ergueu suas lâminas hesitantemente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:240
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_96b19e41:

    # DUPREY "... BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "... COMECE!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:246
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_725c57b7:

    # "We watched as the Captain lunged forward aggressively with the spear."
    "Nós observamos enquanto o Capitão avançava agressivamente com a lança."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:248
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_143afabf:

    # "Much to everyone’s surprise, the girl did far better than expected."
    "Para surpresa de todos, a garota se saiu muito melhor do que o esperado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:249
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_1960f074:

    # "She deflected each blow parried her way and at one point even managed to kick the Captain back with her foot."
    "Ela desviou de cada golpe, aparou os ataques e, em dado momento, até conseguiu chutar o Capitão para trás com o pé."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:252
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_62b6d361:

    # "The possibility that she might win hung tentatively in the air..."
    "A possibilidade de que ela pudesse vencer pairava hesitantemente no ar..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:253
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_af36f2ed:

    # "At the last moment, she managed to deflect another one of the Captain’s blows before swinging for him with what would have been a deathblow."
    "No último momento, ela conseguiu desviar outro golpe do Capitão antes de tentar acertá-lo com o que teria sido um golpe mortal."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:256
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_11ef0394:

    # "Before she could make it though, the Captain reached out his hand and, to everyone’s shock, a bolt of energy blasted the girl so brutally that the wood beneath her splintered as she hit the floor."
    "Antes que ela conseguisse, porém, o Capitão estendeu a mão e, para choque de todos, um raio de energia atingiu a garota com tanta violência que a madeira sob ela se estilhaçou quando ela caiu no chão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:262
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_fcddbd23:

    # "As he brushed himself off, the girl looked up at the Captain, dazed and confused."
    "Enquanto ele se limpava, a garota olhou para o Capitão, atordoada e confusa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:263
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_91988c05:

    # KIARA @ scared "But... {i}how?{/i}"
    KIARA @ scared "Mas... {i}como?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:264
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_9fcae072:

    # KIARA @ scared "There’s no magic circle! How did you—"
    KIARA @ scared "Não há círculo mágico! Como você—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:265
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_5bcc6cd8:

    # DUPREY "A good attempt, girl. You almost had me there."
    DUPREY "Uma boa tentativa, garota. Você quase me pegou."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:266
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_f0504735:

    # "The Captain held out a hand, helping her back to her feet."
    "O Capitão estendeu a mão, ajudando-a a se levantar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:267
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_b6aec33c:

    # "As he pulled her up, he leaned in to whisper something in her ear and his lips curled upwards into a small smile."
    "Enquanto a puxava para cima, ele se inclinou para sussurrar algo em seu ouvido e seus lábios se curvaram num pequeno sorriso."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:268
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_b8ee3afa:

    # KIARA @ scared "I don’t understand though... That kind of magic..."
    KIARA @ scared "Mas eu não entendo... Esse tipo de magia..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:269
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c1f1362c:

    # "The Captain smirked as he kicked some of the hay aside and revealed a magic circle concealed beneath."
    "O Capitão sorriu maliciosamente ao chutar um pouco do feno para o lado e revelar um círculo mágico oculto embaixo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:270
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_a51105ae:

    # "The crowd murmured, half in awe, half in surprise."
    "A multidão murmurou, metade em admiração, metade em surpresa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:271
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_efda234b:

    # DUPREY "Like I said, girl, here, we don’t teach the fancy stuff."
    DUPREY "Como eu disse, garota, aqui, não ensinamos as coisas chiques."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:272
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c762f908:

    # DUPREY "We teach you how to win. No matter what."
    DUPREY "Ensinamos você a vencer. Não importa o que aconteça."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:273
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c59322b4:

    # "The crowd applauded and cheered as the girl smiled sheepishly."
    "A multidão aplaudiu e comemorou enquanto a garota sorria timidamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:275
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_05014119:

    # "When she got off the podium, she was welcomed back by the others who all patted her on the back for a fight well fought."
    "Quando ela desceu do pódio, foi recebida de volta pelos outros, que lhe deram tapinhas nas costas por uma luta bem lutada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:277
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_3e8845e2:

    # DUPREY "Alright everyone!"
    DUPREY "Muito bem, pessoal!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:278
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_53cb2fa8:

    # DUPREY "It's a start alright, but we still have a lot of work ahead of us!"
    DUPREY "É um começo, sim, mas ainda temos muito trabalho pela frente!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:279
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_05bea46f:

    # DUPREY "Now, go and take some rest."
    DUPREY "Agora, vão descansar um pouco."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:281
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_df74a53c:

    # DUPREY "By the time the sun hits these training dummies, I expect you lot here again!"
    DUPREY "Quando o sol bater nesses bonecos de treino, espero vocês aqui de novo!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:282
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "Dispensados!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:300
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_0bd9b2e5:

    # DUPREY "It stands to reason, you maggots."
    DUPREY "É óbvio, seus vermes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:301
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_c6b5eac0:

    # DUPREY "That to {i}kill{/i} the enemy, you must first strike him."
    DUPREY "Que para {i}matar{/i} o inimigo, você deve primeiro atacá-lo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:302
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_75af9096:

    # DUPREY "You cannot hesitate with your blade, not even for a second."
    DUPREY "Você não pode hesitar com sua lâmina, nem por um segundo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:303
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_56b25b16:

    # DUPREY "The Demorai will spare you no quarter."
    DUPREY "Os Demorai não lhe darão trégua."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:304
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_94c5eb63:

    # DUPREY "They know no fear."
    DUPREY "Eles não conhecem o medo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:305
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_87825edf:

    # DUPREY "Hesitation does not exist in the minds of the enemy you will face."
    DUPREY "A hesitação não existe nas mentes do inimigo que você enfrentará."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:306
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_2ae3da65:

    # DUPREY "They will not stop, they will keep coming until {i}you{/i} are dead."
    DUPREY "Eles não vão parar, eles continuarão vindo até que {i}você{/i} esteja morto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:307
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_a1a19941:

    # DUPREY "...So {i}you{/i} will not stop, {i}you{/i} will know no hesitation either."
    DUPREY "...Então {i}você{/i} não vai parar, {i}você{/i} também não conhecerá hesitação."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:308
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_9ef65af9:

    # DUPREY "{i}You{/i} will make them kiss the blades you carry and grant them the death they so crave!"
    DUPREY "{i}Você{/i} os fará beijar as lâminas que carrega e lhes concederá a morte que tanto anseiam!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:309
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_931fd1a0:

    # "There was some cheering, whistles and claps from the recruits, but Captain Duprey remained stoically the same."
    "Houve alguns vivas, assobios e palmas dos recrutas, mas o Capitão Duprey permaneceu estoicamente o mesmo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:310
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_3c541189:

    # DUPREY "When you strike at an enemy, if you're too slow they may dodge or block the strike."
    DUPREY "Quando você ataca um inimigo, se for muito lento, ele pode desviar ou bloquear o golpe."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:311
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_935e6dba:

    # DUPREY "Get used to that feeling of metal clashing, you lose your blade out in the field, {i}you're finished.{/i}"
    DUPREY "Acostume-se com a sensação do metal se chocando; se perder sua lâmina no campo de batalha, {i}você está acabado.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:312
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_bba80207:

    # DUPREY "Now grab someone to spar with."
    DUPREY "Agora pegue alguém para praticar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:313
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_6e24ff53:

    # DUPREY "...BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "...COMEÇAR!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:332
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_7a71149d:

    # MARKUS "That was... good."
    MARKUS "Isso foi... bom."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:333
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b31d8f4f:

    # "Markus caught his breath and asked:"
    "Markus recuperou o fôlego e perguntou:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:334
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_34c43e8a:

    # MARKUS "Say, wanna go again?"
    MARKUS "Ei, quer ir de novo?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:336
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_5d179d76:

    # MARKUS "You could do better, [player_name!t]."
    MARKUS "Você poderia se sair melhor, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:337
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_732df93f:

    # "Markus looked around and figured we could go for another round."
    "Markus olhou em volta e achou que poderíamos ir para outra rodada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:338
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_6c053eec:

    # MARKUS "Let's go again, shall we?"
    MARKUS "Vamos de novo, que tal?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:341
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b09806db:

    # MARKUS "That's my [player_name!t]!"
    MARKUS "Esse é meu [player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:342
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_c9b50785:

    # MARKUS "Let's learn to handle these sticks of ours proper..."
    MARKUS "Vamos aprender a manusear esses bastões nossos direito..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:343
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f9bd7eb4:

    # MC "Sticks of ours? Wha~"
    MC "Bastões nossos? O quê~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:344
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_982720f4:

    # MARKUS "Defend yourself!"
    MARKUS "Defenda-se!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:349
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_73fd8781:

    # MARKUS "Fair enough."
    MARKUS "Justo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:355
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_85180b52:

    # "We have spent the remainder of the day practicing more basic combat moves."
    "Passamos o resto do dia praticando mais movimentos básicos de combate."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:357
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_950ca5f4:

    # "Exhausted, I made my way back towards the barracks."
    "Exausto, me dirigi de volta ao quartel."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:362
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b623e6ef:

    # "Entering the barracks, I was whistled over by a towering warrior I have seen a couple times before in the fort."
    "Ao entrar no quartel, um guerreiro imponente que eu já tinha visto algumas vezes no forte me chamou com um assobio."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:365
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_6adb8189:

    # OFFICER @ talk "[player_name!t], isn't it?"
    OFFICER @ talk "[player_name!t], não é?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:367
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_942cd646:

    # MC @ talk "Yes sir."
    MC @ talk "Sim, senhor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:368
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_9493a3e8:

    # OFFICER @ talk "I am First Officer Borras, Captain Duprey's second in command."
    OFFICER @ talk "Eu sou o Primeiro Oficial Borras, o segundo em comando do Capitão Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:369
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f902ebfc:

    # "I gulped as my body straightened and stiffened on its own."
    "Engoli em seco enquanto meu corpo se endireitava e enrijecia por conta própria."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:370
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b1f42af4:

    # MC @ talk "S-sir?"
    MC @ talk "S-senhor?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:371
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3936d95e:

    # BORRAS @ talk "You're on cleaning duty tonight."
    BORRAS @ talk "Você está de serviço de limpeza esta noite."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:373
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_8629b4ea:

    # MC @ talk "(Arrgh! Come on now!)"
    MC @ talk "(Arrgh! Vamos lá agora!)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:375
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_9a2d9435:

    # MC @ talk "...Yes sir."
    MC @ talk "...Sim, senhor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:378
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f4f3ec57:

    # "I spent the next hour or so mopping, polishing and cleaning the barracks from top to bottom."
    "Passei cerca de uma hora esfregando, polindo e limpando o quartel de cima a baixo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:380
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_00514271:

    # "Finally, I found myself finished."
    "Finalmente, me vi terminado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:381
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_a4f1e169:

    # MC "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    MC "{i}*Suspiro*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:382
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_278d91ab:

    # MC "(All that's left to do is clean the wash area.)"
    MC "(Tudo o que falta fazer é limpar a área de banho.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:383
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_57878b2a:

    # "As I headed in, I heard what sounded like... splashing?"
    "Enquanto eu entrava, ouvi algo que parecia... respingos?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:384
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_68fec10d:

    # "At this hour?"
    "A esta hora?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:385
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_554aa8aa:

    # "Realizing the splashing was coming from the woman's side, I pondered what to do..."
    "Ao perceber que os respingos vinham do lado das mulheres, ponderei o que fazer..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:390
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3b428651:

    # "It had felt like forever since I last got the chance to see a woman naked."
    "Fazia uma eternidade desde a última vez que tive a chance de ver uma mulher nua."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:391
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_bfd776ce:

    # "The temptation was too much to bear, and, letting my curiosity get the best of me, I peeked around the woman's side to take a look."
    "A tentação era demais para suportar, e, deixando a curiosidade tomar conta de mim, espiei pelo lado das mulheres para dar uma olhada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:393
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_adf06afd:

    # "Kiara was squatted down naked, washing herself with a wet flannel and bucket."
    "Kiara estava agachada, nua, lavando-se com uma toalha molhada e um balde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:394
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_a4806da6:

    # KIARA "So, are you just going to stand there and watch?"
    KIARA "Então, você vai só ficar aí parado olhando?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:395
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3d654567:

    # MC @ scared "K-Kiara!"
    MC @ scared "K-Kiara!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:396
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_2df5f315:

    # "Realizing I'd been caught, Kiara, grabbing a towel, wrapped it around herself as she marched over towards me, arms folded."
    "Ao perceber que eu a havia flagrado, Kiara pegou uma toalha, enrolou-a ao redor de si mesma e veio marchando na minha direção, de braços cruzados."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:397
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_a50ae3ab:

    # MC @ scared "It... It isn't what it looked like?"
    MC @ scared "Isso... Isso não é o que pareceu?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:399
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_1ca6c786:

    # "That scout girl I've seen around was squatted down naked, washing herself with a wet flannel and bucket."
    "Aquela garota escoteira que vi por aí estava agachada nua, lavando-se com uma flanela úmida e um balde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:400
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_edca490d:

    # KIARA "Kiara. Pleasure meeting you."
    KIARA "Kiara. Muito prazer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:404
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_2bbabbd5:

    # MC @ scared "Wh-what..."
    MC @ scared "O-que..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:405
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_04b16aef:

    # "As I realized I was caught, I shot words at her in an apologetic burst:"
    "Quando percebi que fui pego, disparei palavras para ela em uma explosão de desculpas:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:406
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3e3db114:

    # MC "[player_name!t], pleasure's all mine, I'm sorry I was~"
    MC "[player_name!t], o prazer é todo meu, desculpe, eu estava~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:407
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_478fa33b:

    # "Kiara grabbed a towel, wrapped it around herself as she marched over towards me, arms folded."
    "Kiara pegou uma toalha, enrolou-a ao redor de si enquanto marchava em minha direção, braços cruzados."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:414
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_cfb43425:

    # KIARA @ angry "So you {i}weren't{/i} just spying on me then?"
    KIARA @ angry "Então você {i}não estava{/i} apenas me espionando, então?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:415
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_77f8c828:

    # MC "N-No, I came here to clean the wash rooms, I swear it so!"
    MC "N-Não, vim aqui para limpar os lavatórios, juro que sim!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:416
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_d56beb53:

    # "Kiara's stern expression softened as she laughed."
    "A expressão severa de Kiara se suavizou quando ela riu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:417
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_812bd8c8:

    # KIARA @ happy "Haha, relax."
    KIARA @ happy "Haha, relaxe."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:418
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_800b5920:

    # KIARA "I'm just playing with you."
    KIARA "Estou apenas brincando com você."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:419
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_4eb41718:

    # "Kiara winked."
    "Kiara piscou."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:420
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_1365d248:

    # KIARA "You can take a look anytime you want, cutie."
    KIARA "Você pode dar uma olhada quando quiser, fofo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:421
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_7ebb922b:

    # MC "I - {i}*Cough*{/i}"
    MC "Eu - {i}*Tosse*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:422
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_80e56fde:

    # MC @ talk "What are you doing here?"
    MC @ talk "O que você está fazendo aqui?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:423
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_7ac5c305:

