# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:569
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_4baaa790:

    # MC "Okay, I'll kick your ass now, {i}captain{/i}."
    MC "Certo, vou te dar uma surra agora, {i}capitão{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:570
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_397f9c31:

    # MARKUS "On guard!"
    MARKUS "Em guarda!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:575
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_82ab4d75:

    # MARKUS "Okay then."
    MARKUS "Está bem então."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:576
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_40b12a4d:

    # MARKUS "It was kinda cool though, wasn't it?"
    MARKUS "Mas foi meio legal, não foi?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:577
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_eb54f1a5:

    # MC "Yeah, beats swinging it against these training dummies!"
    MC "Sim, é melhor que ficar batendo nesses bonecos de treinamento!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:585
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_ba3a1381:

    # "For the remainder of the day, Duprey educated us on the nuances of using various special skills, tools and items in battle."
    "Pelo resto do dia, Duprey nos ensinou as nuances do uso de várias habilidades especiais, ferramentas e itens em batalha."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:586
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_d61d0b14:

    # "Exhausted, I didn't really get much of it: magic refraction scrolls, ensnarement crystals, Vulshan smoke bombs..."
    "Exausto, não entendi muito: pergaminhos de refração mágica, cristais de aprisionamento, bombas de fumaça Vulshan..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:587
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_3a645881:

    # "Come dusk, Duprey concluded with showing us some advanced combat moves, I guess to somehow inspire us to master the art of combat."
    "Ao anoitecer, Duprey concluiu nos mostrando alguns movimentos de combate avançados, acho que para nos inspirar de alguma forma a dominar a arte do combate."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:592
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_ca79f8f3:

    # DUPREY "...So this is how you do the Waltzing Bazark strike."
    DUPREY "...Então é assim que se faz o golpe Waltzing Bazark."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:593
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_7f316660:

    # "Duprey caught his breath after executing a rather spectacular combat move."
    "Duprey recuperou o fôlego após executar um movimento de combate bastante espetacular."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:594
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_55a1cf16:

    # "He scanned the crowd of recruits, totally exhausted from another training session, and I can promise I saw a hint of fatherly smile on his face."
    "Ele examinou a multidão de recrutas, totalmente exaustos de mais uma sessão de treinamento, e posso jurar que vi um leve sorriso paternal em seu rosto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:595
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_56df01de:

    # DUPREY "Okay, you lot."
    DUPREY "Certo, vocês aí."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:596
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_60e9fa7e:

    # DUPREY "Go and take some rest now."
    DUPREY "Vá descansar um pouco agora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:602
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_c70200c9:

    # "Me and Markus looked at each other in confusion:"
    "Eu e Markus nos entreolhamos confusos:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:603
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_b1a7928d:

    # MC "A Waltzing Bazark? I'm not even trying something like that."
    MC "Uma valsa de Bazark? Nem vou tentar algo assim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:604
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_99873a35:

    # MARKUS "You'd be collecting me from all over the yard if I did..."
    MARKUS "Você estaria me recolhendo de todo o quintal se eu fizesse..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:647
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_2a3accbf:

    # REGINA "...[player_name!t]."
    REGINA "...[player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:648
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_7199e905:

    # REGINA "Wake up, [player_name!t]."
    REGINA "Acorde, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:652
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_2a66cc92:

    # "As my eyes slowly peeled open, a dark, raven haired blob was stood, lurched over the side of my bed."
    "Enquanto meus olhos se abriam lentamente, um vulto escuro de cabelo negro estava de pé, debruçado sobre o lado da minha cama."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:653
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_c40f7ba2:

    # "My vision became clearer: there I saw, clear as day, [regina_ref!t] crouched over and smiling towards me."
    "Minha visão ficou mais clara: lá eu vi, claro como o dia, [regina_ref!t] agachada e sorrindo para mim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:654
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_0bbec91f:

    # MC @ surprised "[regina_ref_cap!t]?"
    MC @ surprised "[regina_ref_cap!t]?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:655
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_3fe750ff:

    # "[regina_ref_cap!t] placed her finger over her lip and motioned for me to be silent."
    "[regina_ref_cap!t] colocou o dedo sobre os lábios e fez sinal para eu ficar em silêncio."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:656
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_87f8b481:

    # "{i}Was this some kind of a dream?{/i}"
    "{i}Isso foi algum tipo de sonho?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:657
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_9ce974a4:

    # "She leaned in close to whisper."
    "Ela se aproximou para sussurrar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:658
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_32cf642b:

    # REGINA @ smile "I've bought you some things, dear."
    REGINA @ smile "Comprei algumas coisas para você, querido."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:659
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_6f52509f:

    # REGINA @ talk "{i}Just a little something between the two of us...{/i}"
    REGINA @ talk "{i}Uma coisinha só entre nós dois...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:660
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_caa43851:

    # MC @ surprised "How ... How did you even get in here?"
    MC @ surprised "Como... Como você entrou aqui?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:661
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_257c75a7:

    # REGINA @ talk "Don't worry about that now, dear."
    REGINA @ talk "Não se preocupe com isso agora, querido."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:662
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_eb2e578c:

    # REGINA @ talk "I just wanted to see you."
    REGINA @ talk "Eu só queria ver você."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:663
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_fb531ee6:

    # MC @ talk "But-"
    MC @ talk "Mas-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:664
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_24a60a73:

    # "As her hand gently caressed my cheek, I began to feel myself drifting back to the darkness once again."
    "Enquanto a mão dela acariciava suavemente minha bochecha, comecei a sentir que estava voltando à escuridão mais uma vez."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:666
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_4ff52e4f:

    # "{i}Perhaps, this really was a dream?{/i}"
    "{i}Talvez isso realmente fosse um sonho?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:667
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_ccaef93c:

    # REGINA @ talk "Shhh... {i}Sleep, dear.{/i}"
    REGINA @ talk "Shhh... {i}Durma, meu bem.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:668
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_898758b8:

    # REGINA "{i}I'll always be here for you...{/i}"
    REGINA "{i}Eu sempre estarei aqui por você...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:669
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_3b1abd21:

    # REGINA "{i}...no matter what.{/i}"
    REGINA "{i}...não importa o que aconteça.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:693
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_caba15b5:

    # "Springing upright in my bed, soaked in sweat, I looked around as people prepared themselves for another day of training."
    "De um pulo, sentei-me ereto na cama, encharcado de suor, e olhei ao redor enquanto as pessoas se preparavam para mais um dia de treinamento."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:696
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_4f0b95e9:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]? Are you alright?"
    MARKUS "[player_name!t]? Você está bem?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:697
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_24f0136a:

    # MC @ scared "I ... I think so."
    MC @ scared "Eu... acho que sim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:698
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_328b83d2:

    # MARKUS "Bad dreams?"
    MARKUS "Sonhos ruins?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:700
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_b260c7ad:

    # MC @ scared "...I'm not sure what it was."
    MC @ scared "...Não tenho certeza do que foi."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:701
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d5d45ce3:

    # MARKUS @ shock "Well, you look like you've seen a ghost!"
    MARKUS @ shock "Bem, você parece que viu um fantasma!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:702
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d5193f8a:

    # "Somehow, a ghost felt more explainable than what I saw last night..."
    "De alguma forma, um fantasma parecia mais explicável do que o que eu vi ontem à noite..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:703
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_247c26f4:

    # MARKUS "Come, I'm sure a few whacks from a training sword will take your mind off whatever it was!"
    MARKUS "Venha, tenho certeza que algumas pancadas de uma espada de treinamento vão tirar sua mente do que quer que fosse!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:706
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_a8954217:

    # "As Markus headed out of the barracks towards the training yard, I shook my head, pushing the strange dream aside."
    "Enquanto Markus saía do quartel em direção ao pátio de treinamento, eu balancei a cabeça, afastando o sonho estranho."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:708
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_83da7088:

    # "Opening my chest to grab my uniform, I noticed immediately the strangely placed bottle of red wine that wasn't there before..."
    "Abrindo meu baú para pegar meu uniforme, notei imediatamente a garrafa de vinho tinto estranhamente colocada que não estava lá antes..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:710
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_01b21009:

    # MC @ scared "(It... It was a dream!)"
    MC @ scared "(Foi... Foi um sonho!)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:713
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d62002c2:

    # MC @ think "(...Right?)"
    MC @ think "(...Certo?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:725
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_f1834407:

    # DUPREY "...So, having being around a little, what do you lot think matters the most in battle?"
    DUPREY "...Então, tendo estado por aqui um pouco, o que vocês acham que mais importa na batalha?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:726
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_84edc41c:

    # "We looked at each other puzzled."
    "Nós nos olhamos confusos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:728
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_cef8185e:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Strength?{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}Força?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:729
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_6cf01769:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Our gear!{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}Nosso equipamento!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:730
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_5b70b478:

    # "Some of us were throwing more words out there, until..."
    "Alguns de nós estavam jogando mais palavras por aí, até que..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:731
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_59efef91:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Being like... a single force?{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}Sendo como... uma força única?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:732
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_60c375e0:

    # "I swear I saw a hint of suprise on Duprey's face:"
    "Juro que vi um lampejo de surpresa no rosto de Duprey:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:733
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_a52d9426:

    # DUPREY @ laugh "Right on, lad!"
    DUPREY @ laugh "Isso aí, rapaz!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:734
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_ae81de48:

    # "Silence covered our ranks, as we have began to realize what today's lesson was about."
    "O silêncio cobriu nossas fileiras, enquanto começávamos a perceber sobre o que era a lição de hoje."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:735
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_c6bbed4f:

    # "Duprey smiled for a moment as he continued:"
    "Duprey sorriu por um momento e continuou:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:736
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_f6068bdd:

    # DUPREY "Teamwork, lads."
    DUPREY "Trabalho em equipe, rapazes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:737
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_2c171579:

    # DUPREY "Confidence in a soldier to your left and a soldier to your right, {i}this{/i} is the driving force behind any worthy army."
    DUPREY "Confiança no soldado à sua esquerda e no soldado à sua direita, {i}essa{/i} é a força motriz por trás de qualquer exército digno."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:738
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_479fffc2:

    # "Duprey began pointing at recruits from the crowd:"
    "Duprey começou a apontar para recrutas na multidão:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:739
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_54599814:

    # DUPREY "You can have the best gear in all Alderay!"
    DUPREY "Você pode ter o melhor equipamento de toda Alderay!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:740
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_fae39187:

    # DUPREY "And you can be an expert at handling your weapon of choice,"
    DUPREY "E você pode ser um especialista no manuseio da arma de sua escolha,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:741
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_812a5810:

    # DUPREY "While your bag of dirty tricks can grow as large as to become a caravan,"
    DUPREY "Enquanto sua sacola de truques sujos pode crescer a ponto de se tornar uma caravana,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:742
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_671d40a2:

    # "Some recruits laughed as Duprey continued, ever more serious:"
    "Alguns recrutas riram enquanto Duprey continuava, cada vez mais sério:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:743
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_2ff1717a:

    # DUPREY "But if you don't have a warrior, a true battle brother you are dead sure in at your side,"
    DUPREY "Mas se você não tem um guerreiro, um verdadeiro irmão de batalha em quem você confia plenamente ao seu lado,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:744
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_ff502967:

    # DUPREY "One who would stand with you no matter what is coming at you..."
    DUPREY "Alguém que ficaria ao seu lado não importa o que venha contra você..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:745
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_95d64e38:

    # "Duprey's expression turned pale for a moment, as if his mind's eye erupted with memories."
    "A expressão de Duprey ficou pálida por um momento, como se os olhos de sua mente explodissem com memórias."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:746
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_fa17f4b8:

    # DUPREY "You {i}will be{/i} obliterated."
    DUPREY "Você {i}será{/i} obliterado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:747
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_828b281f:

    # "Me and Markus looked at each other and nodded stoically, but Duprey's usual commanding tone snapped us out of it quick:"
    "Eu e Markus nos entreolhamos e acenamos estoicamente, mas o tom autoritário usual de Duprey nos tirou disso rapidamente:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:748
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_b5b6ec4e:

    # DUPREY "None of us would want that to happen, right you maggots?!"
    DUPREY "Nenhum de nós gostaria que isso acontecesse, não é, seus vermes?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:750
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_41a3cf71:

    # DUPREY "Today, you will spar in teams of two!"
    DUPREY "Hoje, vocês vão lutar em duplas!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:751
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_dfb15ac9:

    # DUPREY "Partner up, and get to it!"
    DUPREY "Formem duplas e mãos à obra!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:752
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_6e24ff53:

    # DUPREY "...BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "...COMEÇAR!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:776
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_22336bc1:

    # MARKUS "Phew... You guys kicked our ass!"
    MARKUS "Ufa... Vocês nos deram uma surra!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:777
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_d5403c39:

    # MARKUS "Let's go again now!"
    MARKUS "Vamos de novo agora!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:778
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_d4066694:

    # MARKUS "I swear you won't get us this time!"
    MARKUS "Juro que vocês não vão nos pegar desta vez!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:780
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_4303ca27:

    # "Markus and his teammate both looked at us two."
    "Markus e seu colega de equipe olharam para nós dois."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:781
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_4c68b6fe:

    # MARKUS "Come on guys, remember what Duprey said!"
    MARKUS "Vamos lá, pessoal, lembrem-se do que Duprey disse!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:782
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_072ed379:

    # MARKUS "Be a single force!"
    MARKUS "Sejam uma única força!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:783
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_7e6c58ca:

    # "His teammate interrupted:"
    "O colega dele interrompeu:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:785
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_c87c6273:

    # RECRUIT "Actually... it was me who said it..."
    RECRUIT "Na verdade... fui eu quem disse isso..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:786
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_76d4b651:

    # "I let out a laugh which echoed painfully all over my body."
    "Soltei uma risada que ecoou dolorosamente por todo o meu corpo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:787
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_33a51547:

    # MARKUS "... Whatever! Come on, let's go for another round!"
    MARKUS "... Tanto faz! Venha, vamos para mais uma rodada!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:790
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_2af51c90:

    # MARKUS "That's what I like to hear!"
    MARKUS "É isso que eu gosto de ouvir!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:791
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_102beb74:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Let's see if our 'army' defeats yours this time!"
    MARKUS @ smile "Vamos ver se o nosso 'exército' derrota o seu desta vez!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:795
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_82ab4d75:

    # MARKUS "Okay then."
    MARKUS "Tudo bem, então."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:796
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_1506ca74:

    # MARKUS "I've sprained my ankle anyways..."
    MARKUS "De qualquer forma, eu torci o tornozelo..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:799
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_3c091867:

    # "The rest of the day we have spent learning more nuances about working together as a combat unit."
    "O resto do dia passamos aprendendo mais nuances sobre como trabalhar juntos como uma unidade de combate."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:800
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_1da7d2b2:

    # "As we have come to realize the importance of teamwork in practice, Duprey's initial statement of it being the crucial aspect of warfare became clear as day."
    "Conforme percebemos na prática a importância do trabalho em equipe, a afirmação inicial de Duprey de que era o aspecto crucial da guerra ficou clara como o dia."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:801
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_73c0dac8:

    # "We had to {i}become{/i} the Second Scouts Division."
    "Tivemos que {i}nos tornar{/i} a Segunda Divisão de Escoteiros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:806
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5d262372:

    # DUPREY "...So, that will be it for today, Scouts."
    DUPREY "...Então, é isso por hoje, Escoteiros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:807
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_b8c44b07:

    # DUPREY "And one more thing..."
    DUPREY "E mais uma coisa..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:808
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_f2c412ef:

    # DUPREY "We can't be training in this cage forever,"
    DUPREY "Não podemos treinar nesta jaula para sempre,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:809
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_fc3f4089:

    # "Duprey waved at the walls,"
    "Duprey acenou para as paredes,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:810
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5bc59c1b:

    # DUPREY "But before we begin any real training maneuvers, I need to see just how much you lot had learned since you've got here."
    DUPREY "Mas antes de começarmos com manobras de treinamento de verdade, preciso ver o quanto vocês aprenderam desde que chegaram aqui."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:811
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_37c4720a:

    # DUPREY "Hit that bunk hard for there will be a test tomorrow!"
    DUPREY "Deitem-se já porque amanhã haverá um teste!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:812
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "Dispensados!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:817
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_70c270b5:

    # "Me and Markus exchanged looks."
    "Eu e Markus trocamos olhares."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:818
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5dbd6a38:

    # MARKUS "A test, huh?"
    MARKUS "Um teste, hein?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:819
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_0da95cfe:

    # MC "Whatever it is, let's go get some sleep."
    MC "Seja lá o que for, vamos dormir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:836
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6d3b7e65:

    # "In the dead of night, I was restless."
    "Na calada da noite, eu estava inquieto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:841
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8c266e01:

    # "Opening my eyes, I sat-upright in my bunk and looked around."
    "Abrindo os olhos, sentei-me direito no beliche e olhei em volta."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:843
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ccd5a8ea:

    # "Everyone around me was deep in sleep still, including Markus."
    "Todos ao meu redor ainda estavam profundamente adormecidos, incluindo Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:844
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_03bec688:

    # "I sighed, rubbing my forehead as I climbed out of bed."
    "Suspirei, esfregando a testa enquanto saía da cama."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:845
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b9564fe7:

    # "{i}Just a short walk around the fort grounds{/i} I told myself..."
    "{i}Apenas uma curta caminhada pelos terrenos do forte{/i} eu disse a mim mesmo..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:846
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_af74cbd2:

    # "I'll be back before anyone even realizes I'm gone."
    "Estarei de volta antes que alguém perceba que saí."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:853
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59eaf8b8:

    # "As the cold night air hit my lungs, I thought about heading back inside before I heard Captain Duprey's voice."
    "Quando o ar frio da noite entrou em meus pulmões, pensei em voltar para dentro antes de ouvir a voz do Capitão Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:854
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_4acebe14:

    # DUPREY "Thank you all for coming..."
    DUPREY "Obrigado a todos por terem vindo..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:855
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_14ad4098:

    # MC "(Hm? What's going on?)"
    MC "(Hm? O que está acontecendo?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:856
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b6dd5166:

    # MC "(It sounds like it's coming from the training yard.)"
    MC "(Parece que está vindo do pátio de treinamento.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:867
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f159a15b:

    # "Peering around the corner, Captain Duprey stood alongside Borras as two figures joined them."
    "Espiando ao redor da esquina, o Capitão Duprey estava ao lado de Borras enquanto duas figuras se juntavam a eles."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:870
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_683fa502:

    # "The first, a beautiful, yet stern and cold looking blonde in a hooded robe."
    "A primeira, uma loira bonita, mas severa e fria, vestindo um manto com capuz."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:871
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_39c09853:

    # "The other, a man of larger stature who I had not seen either."
    "O outro, um homem de estatura maior que eu também não tinha visto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:873
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c3816f8a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Well, out with it."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Bem, fale logo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:874
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_829708c2:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Why did you ask us to meet here and not in my office?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Por que você pediu para nos encontrarmos aqui e não no meu escritório?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:875
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e5dab11:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "I'm freezing my tits off out here you know."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Estou congelando os peitos aqui fora, sabia."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:876
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f5d90ff9:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "I could keep them warm for you if you wish."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Eu poderia mantê-los quentes para você, se quiser."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:878
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8cce2042:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Lay a hand on me and you will never {i}touch{/i} anything again."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Coloque uma mão em mim e você nunca mais {i}tocará{/i} em nada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:879
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ccb33939:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Feisty as always."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Briguenta como sempre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:880
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7d3baf97:

    # DUPREY "I'm sorry for summoning you both at such a late hour."
    DUPREY "Desculpe por convocar vocês dois a uma hora tão tardia."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:881
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_438696b5:

    # DUPREY "I couldn't risk the potential of spies listening in on what I had to say now."
    DUPREY "Eu não podia arriscar a possibilidade de espiões ouvirem o que eu tinha a dizer agora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:882
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_15a278d5:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "And out here is safer than my office how?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "E como aqui fora é mais seguro que meu escritório?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:883
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8ea753ae:

    # DUPREY "{i}*Sigh*{/i} I recently conducted a private search across the whole fortress with only my most trusted men."
    DUPREY "{i}*Suspiro*{/i} Recentemente conduzi uma busca privada por toda a fortaleza apenas com meus homens mais confiáveis."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:884
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_627d96fc:

    # DUPREY "I found echo crystals everywhere... including your office."
    DUPREY "Encontrei cristais de eco por toda parte... incluindo seu escritório."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:885
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e306341:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "You..."
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "Você..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:886
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2b146927:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "{i}Echo crystals?{/i}"
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "{i}Cristais de eco?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:887
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c7cc2c81:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "That can't be right, I have my office checked, I-"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Não pode ser verdade, eu mando verificar meu escritório, eu-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:888
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7233b5ac:

    # "Duprey nodded, holding up a small, glowing yellow crystal that he tossed to the robed blonde."
    "Duprey assentiu, segurando um pequeno cristal amarelo brilhante que ele jogou para a loira de manto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:890
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b21cd245:

    # DUPREY "I'm afraid it's so."
    DUPREY "Receio que sim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:891
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3e335085:

    # "The woman inspected the crystal and gritted her teeth in anger at it."
    "A mulher inspecionou o cristal e rangeu os dentes de raiva ao vê-lo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:892
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_1faccc03:

    # DUPREY "It seems our great {i}'emperor'{/i} does not hold our loyalty in high regard."
    DUPREY "Parece que nosso grande {i}'imperador'{/i} não tem nossa lealdade em alta conta."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:893
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d6956b86:

    # "The larger man chuckled."
    "O homem maior riu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:894
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cac71787:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "After everything that's happened, can you truly blame him?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Depois de tudo o que aconteceu, você pode realmente culpá-lo?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:895
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e7113e66:

    # "The blonde woman seemed more frustrated than the others, coiling her one hand into a tight fist."
    "A mulher loira parecia mais frustrada que as outras, fechando uma das mãos em um punho cerrado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:896
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_897edc9c:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Come now, this is all part of the game."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Ora, isso tudo faz parte do jogo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:897
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_da595d25:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Yes, I... I am aware."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Sim, eu... eu estou ciente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:898
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_aed55156:

    # DUPREY "The guards only patrol this area periodically, and it's the one place no echo crystals turned up during the search."
    DUPREY "Os guardas patrulham esta área apenas periodicamente, e é o único lugar onde não foram encontrados cristais de eco durante a busca."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:899
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cf9fe043:

    # DUPREY "I suppose they figured the chatter of grunts wasn't worth hearing."
    DUPREY "Suponho que acharam que a conversa dos soldados rasos não valia a pena ouvir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:900
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_4b3ecc3c:

    # DUPREY "Which is exactly why we're meeting here now."
    DUPREY "Que é exatamente por isso que estamos nos encontrando aqui agora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:901
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97cd58fc:

    # "The larger man raised his brow."
    "O homem maior ergueu a sobrancelha."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:902
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c4efb787:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "That's all well and good... But why exactly is {i}he{/i} here?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "Isso é tudo muito bom... Mas por que exatamente {i}ele{/i} está aqui?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:903
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0ecda2cd:

    # "The man pointed towards Borras, whose brow furrowed at the comment."
    "O homem apontou para Borras, que franziu a testa com o comentário."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:904
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a377fbed:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ angry "He's hardly fit to stand here with the rest of us."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ angry "Ele mal está em condições de estar aqui com o resto de nós."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:905
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_000b3a6c:

    # DUPREY "Officer Borras will be replacing me for command of the Second Scouts Division, within a year or so."
    DUPREY "O oficial Borras me substituirá no comando da Segunda Divisão de Batedores, em cerca de um ano."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:906
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ade1214e:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "You're leaving?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "Você está partindo?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:907
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2897e861:

    # DUPREY "My time is nearly up... I'm slowing down too much."
    DUPREY "Meu tempo está quase acabando... Estou ficando lento demais."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:908
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_1d99c218:

    # "While the blonde seemed saddened to hear this, the larger man opened his palm upwards towards the sky."
    "Enquanto a loira parecia entristecida ao ouvir isso, o homem maior abriu a palma da mão para cima, em direção ao céu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:909
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c246e162:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "I hope you didn't drag us out here to discuss your future retirement plans you old fuck."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Espero que não tenha nos arrastado até aqui para discutir seus planos de aposentadoria, seu velho do caralho."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:910
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dd633049:

    # DUPREY "Hmph..."
    DUPREY "Hmph..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:911
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_07d9c1a1:

    # DUPREY "Officer Borras, hand them the reports."
    DUPREY "Oficial Borras, entregue-lhes os relatórios."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:912
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_85fc15c1:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Yes Captain."
    BORRAS @ talk "Sim, capitão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:914
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a550ea4e:

    # "Borras handed over a few sheets of paper towards the robed pair."
    "Borras entregou algumas folhas de papel ao par encapuzado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:915
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e077ed9f:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "What's this?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "O que é isso?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:916
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cbb0024b:

    # DUPREY "A report that Alcott attempted to suppress."
    DUPREY "Um relatório que Alcott tentou suprimir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:917
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0873ff5f:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "About?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "Sobre?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:918
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dfb5dc62:

    # DUPREY "...{i}Zanarak has returned.{/i}"
    DUPREY "...{i}Zanarak retornou.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:919
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dbf78d30:

    # "A great unease filled the air and I felt a shiver tingle it's way up my spine."
    "Um grande mal-estar encheu o ar e senti um arrepio percorrer minha espinha."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:920
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_506be64d:

    # "The name crawled and dragged its way horribly across my thoughts."
    "O nome rastejou e arrastou-se horrivelmente pelos meus pensamentos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:921
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_04766be0:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "There hasn't been a sighting in years."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Não houve nenhum avistamento em anos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:922
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ad6d35ce:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Wasn't it reported that the beast was hunted down by the Inquisition?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Não foi relatado que a besta foi caçada pela Inquisição?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:923
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cbbee22b:

    # DUPREY "A lie told to ease panicking nobles."
    DUPREY "Uma mentira contada para acalmar nobres em pânico."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:924
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_38a43a2d:

    # DUPREY "While it is true the beast has vanished for the last few years, this cannot be ignored."
    DUPREY "Embora seja verdade que a besta desapareceu nos últimos anos, isso não pode ser ignorado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:925
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_78892759:

    # DUPREY "The beast's return... changes things."
    DUPREY "O retorno da besta... muda as coisas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:926
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7a86413b:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "A specter, a boogeyman..."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Um espectro, um bicho-papão..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:927
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a777b442:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "There are dozens of Demorai over the years that people have wrongly mistaken for being Zanarak."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Há dezenas de Demorai ao longo dos anos que as pessoas confundiram erroneamente com Zanarak."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:928
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_086782c0:

    # "The man belligerently crossed his arms."
    "O homem cruzou os braços de forma beligerante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:929
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ee8e9a7d:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...I'm not even convinced this Zanarak was real to begin with."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...Nem estou convencido de que esse Zanarak fosse real, para começar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:930
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8ebb0762:

    # DUPREY "Oh... He's as real as you and I alright."
    DUPREY "Ah... Ele é tão real quanto você e eu, sim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:931
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ba99ad23:

    # DUPREY "Make no mistake about that."
    DUPREY "Não tenha dúvidas quanto a isso."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:932
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6b72d9c8:

    # DUPREY "...And when he comes, all of us need to be prepared."
    DUPREY "...E quando ele vier, todos nós precisamos estar preparados."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:933
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2bce0fc0:

    # DUPREY "With, {i}or without{/i} the Emperors knowledge."
    DUPREY "Com, {i}ou sem{/i} o conhecimento do Imperador."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:934
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3cdbebf1:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "What are you saying, Duprey?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "O que você está dizendo, Duprey?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:935
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59e5864b:

    # DUPREY "I'm saying, Alcott can bury his head in the fucking sand and play politics all he wants to try and appease wet-fart nobles."
    DUPREY "Estou dizendo, Alcott pode enfiar a cabeça na maldita areia e fazer politicagem o quanto quiser para tentar apaziguar nobres peidorrentos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:936
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_fcc3f2c9:

    # DUPREY "{i}But we need to be prepared for what's to come whether this knowledge is made public or not.{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}Mas precisamos estar preparados para o que está por vir, quer este conhecimento se torne público ou não.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:937
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_18e7a24a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Duprey... You need to tread carefully with this."
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Duprey... Você precisa pisar com cuidado nisso."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:938
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_5b839082:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "How exactly did {i}you{/i} manage to get your hands on this report anyway?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Como exatamente {i}você{/i} conseguiu pôr as mãos nesse relatório, afinal?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:939
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a2aca459:

    # BORRAS @ talk "By pure chance."
    BORRAS @ talk "Por puro acaso."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:940
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a174e1ce:

    # "Borras stepped forward."
    "Borras deu um passo à frente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:941
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_913c0dc3:

    # BORRAS @ talk "I was on a normal patrol through the Valley of Death when I stumbled upon a small, slaughtered convoy."
    BORRAS @ talk "Eu estava em uma patrulha normal pelo Vale da Morte quando me deparei com um pequeno comboio massacrado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:942
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_787647a3:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Amongst their dead was an Inquisitor, who with his dying breath handed me this report."
    BORRAS @ talk "Entre os mortos havia um Inquisidor, que com seu último suspiro me entregou este relatório."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:943
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a7d9dd7a:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "The dying words of a delusional Inquisitor on death's door mean very little."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "As palavras de um Inquisidor delirante à beira da morte significam muito pouco."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:944
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_46254da9:

    # BORRAS @ talk "There was other reports..."
    BORRAS @ talk "Havia outros relatórios..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:945
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f3335e6e:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "What?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "O quê?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:946
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_825a1215:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Suppressed as soon as they arrive, but more and more scant reports from our men on the fringes have reported seeing it."
    BORRAS @ talk "Suprimidos assim que chegam, mas mais e mais relatos escassos de nossos homens nas fronteiras têm relatado vê-lo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:947
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0d7eadc0:

    # "Both the woman and man were troubled the more they heard."
    "Tanto a mulher quanto o homem ficaram mais perturbados quanto mais ouviam."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:948
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f2428e23:

    # DUPREY "From now on, the three of us need to work closer together."
    DUPREY "De agora em diante, nós três precisamos trabalhar mais de perto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:949
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a899d6c2:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "The city guard is barely holding on as it is, what exactly do you expect me to do?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "A guarda da cidade mal está se mantendo como está, o que exatamente você espera que eu faça?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:950
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b10a0545:

    # DUPREY "Whatever you have to do when the time comes."
    DUPREY "O que você tiver que fazer quando chegar a hora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:951
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6afc1660:

    # "Duprey seemed to be working himself up into a feverish plea."
    "Duprey parecia estar se exaltando em um apelo febril."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:952
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_104f25e1:

    # DUPREY "These little camps everyone's set up is leaving us more divided than ever, it'll be the ruin of us all!"
    DUPREY "Esses pequenos acampamentos que todos montaram estão nos deixando mais divididos do que nunca, será a ruína de todos nós!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:953
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2e21a987:

    # DUPREY "We need to unite and pledge to each other that when the time comes-"
    DUPREY "Precisamos nos unir e prometer uns aos outros que quando a hora chegar-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:954
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59c8c819:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "I promise you nothing, Duprey."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Não prometo nada a você, Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:955
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e629b28d:

    # "The broad man's words cut through Duprey's like ice."
    "As palavras do homem largo cortaram as de Duprey como gelo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:956
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b4c2c3b7:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...But I shall look into these reports myself."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...Mas eu mesmo investigarei esses relatórios."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:957
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ebf4078c:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "And depending on what I find, {i}perhaps{/i} there will be more to discuss."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "E dependendo do que eu encontrar, {i}talvez{/i} haja mais a discutir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:958
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e102cb4c:

    # "The broad man turned to leave, and as he did so, Captain Duprey looked towards the woman."
    "O homem largo se virou para sair, e enquanto o fazia, o Capitão Duprey olhou para a mulher."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:959
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6ff2487b:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "... I don't know, Duprey, this just maybe isn't the right time."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "... Eu não sei, Duprey, talvez este simplesmente não seja o momento certo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:960
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ece5bef6:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "The more we unite our forces, the more we paint ourselves a target for the other factions."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "Quanto mais unimos nossas forças, mais nos tornamos um alvo para as outras facções."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:961
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f5cdc275:

    # DUPREY "... I don't care about the factions."
    DUPREY "... Eu não me importo com as facções."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:962
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_361df80b:

    # DUPREY "I don't care about the politics of the damn thing."
    DUPREY "Eu não me importo com a política dessa droga."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:963
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_538b8cf8:

    # DUPREY "What does any of that matter if there's no one left in the end?"
    DUPREY "De que adianta tudo isso se no final não sobrar ninguém?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:964
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c7e9daac:

    # DUPREY "Newheart is gone... There's no one left to save us but ourselves now."
    DUPREY "Newheart se foi... Não há mais ninguém para nos salvar além de nós mesmos agora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:965
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e94a49a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "...Goodnight, Duprey."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "...Boa noite, Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:966
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2d5676a4:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "I hope you're wrong about all this... I really do."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "Espero que você esteja errado sobre tudo isso... espero mesmo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:967
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3bff260d:

    # "The woman turned to leave and join the broad man, leaving Captain Duprey to stand beside Officer Borras alone."
    "A mulher virou-se para sair e se juntar ao homem corpulento, deixando o Capitão Duprey e o Oficial Borras sozinhos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:971
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_9b060e61:

    # "As the two figures passed me by, I hid myself behind a barrel and waited for them to be out of sight."
    "Enquanto as duas figuras passavam por mim, me escondi atrás de um barril e esperei que saíssem de vista."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:974
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d553e83d:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Captain..."
    BORRAS @ talk "Capitão..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:975
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_eba06326:

    # DUPREY "Return to your quarters, Borras."
    DUPREY "Volte para os seus aposentos, Borras."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:976
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6fa2cda7:

    # DUPREY "Speak nothing of what has been said tonight."
    DUPREY "Não fale nada do que foi dito esta noite."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:977
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f9c712a9:

    # BORRAS @ sad "But-"
    BORRAS @ sad "Mas-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:978
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_87e8ae86:

    # DUPREY "I'm tired Borras... So very tired."
    DUPREY "Estou cansado, Borras... Tão cansado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:979
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0ae2d5a5:

    # DUPREY "The next battle can wait for another day."
    DUPREY "A próxima batalha pode esperar por outro dia."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:982
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a5187100:

    # "Slowly, I watched as Captain Duprey slumped towards the barracks, likely back to his quarters."
    "Lentamente, observei enquanto o Capitão Duprey se arrastava em direção ao quartel, provavelmente de volta para seus aposentos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:984
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e034c8e5:

    # MC "(Zanarak... Can it really be?)"
    MC "(Zanarak... Pode realmente ser?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:986
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97d93231:

    # "I shook my head, pushing the terrible thoughts away."
    "Balancei a cabeça, afastando os pensamentos terríveis."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:987
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d2897e6b:

    # MC "(I need to return to my bed, before someone sees me.)"
    MC "(Preciso voltar para minha cama, antes que alguém me veja.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:993
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97284131:

    # "As I laid down onto the bed, dark, terrible thoughts and dreams returned."
    "Quando me deitei na cama, pensamentos e sonhos sombrios e terríveis retornaram."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:994
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_af180033:

    # "Returned to torment me for the rest of the night."
    "Retornaram para me atormentar pelo resto da noite."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1009
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_eb24fb27:

    # DUPREY "Alright maggots, today I will see whether you lot have made any progress or had you just wasted my time!"
    DUPREY "Certo, vermes, hoje verei se vocês fizeram algum progresso ou se apenas desperdiçaram meu tempo!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1010
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_884243ea:

    # DUPREY "We will start with duels first!"
    DUPREY "Começaremos com duelos primeiro!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1011
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_62189e19:

    # DUPREY "Partner up, grab yourself a healing vial, and fight as if your life depended on it!"
    DUPREY "Formem pares, peguem um frasco de cura, e lutem como se suas vidas dependessem disso!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1016
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_761342c6:

    # MC "Shit got real, huh?"
    MC "A coisa ficou séria, hein?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1017
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_67044540:

    # "Markus was certainly not going to fool around this time."
    "Markus certamente não iria fazer graça desta vez."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1018
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_d92306b7:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Come on, [player_name!t], let's do this!"
    MARKUS @ angry "Vamos, [player_name!t], vamos fazer isso!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1019
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_bc95234e:

    # MC @ angry "Alright, bring it on then!"
    MC @ angry "Certo, manda ver então!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1053
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_1263e952:

    # "Ouch."
    "Ai."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1054
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_c58b41a1:

    # "Darkness."
    "Escuridão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1055
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_8f6cd72d:

    # "Then, dim light telling shapes apart."
    "Então, uma luz fraca distinguindo as formas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1056
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_ce93bfa4:

    # "A vision."
    "Uma visão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1057
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_a05d37f2:

    # "A vision of Alderay under demonic onslaught."
    "Uma visão de Alderay sob ataque demoníaco."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1058
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_f32b1941:

    # "Of me, defending it's people."
    "De mim, defendendo seu povo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1059
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_27cd56c1:

    # "Uniting them under my banners."
    "Unindo-os sob minhas bandeiras."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1060
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_63b84b20:

    # "Power."
    "Poder."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1061
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_008f17f9:

    # "Wealth."
    "Riqueza."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1062
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_d7eea514:

    # "Women..."
    "Mulheres..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1063
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_b6ce6190:

    # "However, there is something else."
    "No entanto, há algo mais."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1064
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_8bf4ebd2:

    # "Something that drives me onwards, something from outside..."
    "Algo que me impulsiona, algo de fora..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1065
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_90b93b6a:

    # "It's..."
    "É..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1068
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_d1df3db6:

    # "Ice-cold water!"
    "Água gelada!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1074
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_bc5c4518:

    # DUPREY "{b}ON YOUR FEET, MAGGOT!{/b}"
    DUPREY "{b}DE PÉ, VERME!{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1075
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_5ad11caa:

    # "Captain Duprey's heavy kick quickly stood me up straight, recent knockout echoing in my head with an irritating, pulsing pain."
    "O chute pesado do Capitão Duprey rapidamente me fez ficar de pé, o recente nocaute ecoando em minha cabeça com uma dor irritante e pulsante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1076
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_e7a57264:

    # DUPREY "Go again, Demorai won't wait for you to come back to your senses!"
    DUPREY "Vá de novo, Demorai não vai esperar você voltar a si!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1077
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_032e9f26:

    # MC "(Gotta get a grip...)"
    MC "(Preciso me controlar...)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1078
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_523ecf6e:

    # DUPREY @ angry "I'm trying to be nice to you maggot, now go again!"
    DUPREY @ angry "Estou tentando ser legal com você, verme, agora vá de novo!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1090
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_6a4925e0:

    # MARKUS "Gah! You sure know how to make it hurt!"
    MARKUS "Gah! Você com certeza sabe como fazer doer!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1091
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0fb6a986:

    # MC "{i}*Huff*{/i} Someone’s had to knock some sense into you!"
    MC "{i}*Huff*{/i} Alguém tinha que colocar juízo na sua cabeça!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1092
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_66516ca5:

    # "As me and Markus caught our breath, I noticed an unusual figure dressed in fine fabrics speaking to the Captain."
    "Enquanto eu e Markus recuperávamos o fôlego, notei uma figura incomum vestida com tecidos finos falando com o Capitão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1093
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_163ee6d6:

    # "The Captain seemed unimpressed with whatever the man was saying and seemed to be refusing him something before being handed what seemed like a very official looking letter."
    "O Capitão parecia não se impressionar com o que o homem dizia e parecia estar recusando algo a ele antes que lhe entregassem o que parecia ser uma carta de aparência muito oficial."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1094
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_783e0863:

    # "I thought I could make out the royal seal."
    "Achei que podia distinguir o selo real."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1095
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_edb3c6df:

    # "I couldn’t hear what was being said, but I managed to figure out the words escaping his lips, {i}‘They’re not ready yet!’{/i}"
    "Eu não conseguia ouvir o que estava sendo dito, mas consegui decifrar as palavras que escapavam de seus lábios, {i}‘Eles ainda não estão prontos!’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1096
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7e66af39:

    # MARKUS "What’s going on?"
    MARKUS "O que está acontecendo?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1097
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_28993885:

    # "I nudged him to look over towards Duprey."
    "Eu o cutuquei para que olhasse na direção de Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1098
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_78c93499:

    # MARKUS "... Is that someone from the palace?"
    MARKUS "... É alguém do palácio?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1099
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_6da37e5e:

    # MC "I think so."
    MC "Acho que sim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1100
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_c390d19a:

    # MARKUS "Since when did the palace send its fancy officials down to us mud and grunts?"
    MARKUS "Desde quando o palácio envia seus oficiais elegantes para o meio da lama e dos grunhidos?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1101
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d52535a2:

    # MARKUS "What do you think they want? It must be serious."
    MARKUS "O que você acha que eles querem? Deve ser algo sério."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1102
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_67965d23:

    # MC "I don’t know... but I don’t think it’s going to be anything good."
    MC "Não sei... mas não acho que vá ser algo bom."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1107
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_452c6b58:

    # "All of a sudden, the Captain heaved himself reluctantly onto the wooden platform and cried out for our attention."
    "De repente, o Capitão se arrastou relutantemente para a plataforma de madeira e gritou por nossa atenção."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1108
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_4074b31d:

    # DUPREY "FORM RANKS!"
    DUPREY "FORMAR FILEIRAS!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1110
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7bdc104e:

    # "The tired and weary Scouts hastily moved to form neat rows and face the Captain, hanging on his every word."
    "Os Escoteiros cansados e exaustos rapidamente se moveram para formar filas organizadas e encararam o Capitão, atentos a cada palavra sua."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1111
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d0187a8e:

    # DUPREY "We have been ordered on early leave for a mission."
    DUPREY "Fomos ordenados a sair mais cedo em licença para uma missão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1112
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_af5fac36:

    # "Confused mutterings swept through the ranks, as most of us expected the training to last for months."
    "Murmúrios confusos percorreram as fileiras, já que a maioria de nós esperava que o treinamento durasse meses."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1113
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_41c2d6b4:

    # DUPREY "SILENCE!!!"
    DUPREY "SILÊNCIO!!!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1114
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_219c5f53:

    # DUPREY "This order has come down from Emperor Alcott himself and has been approved by King Mesamor."
    DUPREY "Esta ordem veio diretamente do Imperador Alcott e foi aprovada pelo Rei Mesamor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1115
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8b792546:

    # DUPREY "We leave come first light tomorrow."
    DUPREY "Partimos amanhã ao amanhecer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1116
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0fa47cd9:

    # DUPREY "Get to bed early, make sure you’re well fed and be absolutely certain that your equipment is clean and ready."
    DUPREY "Vão para a cama cedo, certifiquem-se de que estão bem alimentados e tenham a certeza de que o equipamento está limpo e pronto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1117
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_cae6e8d4:

    # "A timid hand was raised from the crowd."
    "Uma mão tímida levantou-se da multidão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1118
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_c2e2d792:

    # DUPREY "What is it?"
    DUPREY "O que é?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1120
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_13b24539:

    # RECRUIT "Where are we to be sent, sir?"
    RECRUIT "Para onde seremos enviados, senhor?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1121
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_544b0d7d:

    # DUPREY "The mission is top secret, all I can tell you is that you will be recovering relics from a lost fortress south of here."
    DUPREY "A missão é ultrassecreta, tudo o que posso dizer é que irão recuperar relíquias de uma fortaleza perdida ao sul daqui."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1122
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0ac7589b:

    # DUPREY "Expect at least six weeks march, take this into consideration with your prep."
    DUPREY "Esperem uma marcha de pelo menos seis semanas, levem isso em consideração nos preparativos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1123
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "Dispensados!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1126
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8cfa9b03:

    # "With that, the Captain stormed his way off stage, angrily shoving the sealed letter back into the fumbling hands of the palace official before stalking back to his quarters."
    "Com isso, o Capitão saiu furioso do palco, empurrando com raiva a carta selada de volta para as mãos atrapalhadas do funcionário do palácio antes de voltar para seus aposentos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1127
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fa69c2ee:

    # "The men soon dissolved the ranks and the process of packing up for our departure began."
    "Os homens logo desfizeram as fileiras e o processo de arrumação para nossa partida começou."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1133
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_73d9be9c:

    # "There was much confused chatter about what this {i}‘secret mission’{/i} entailed, and more so the worry of now being confronted by the Demorai so clearly unprepared."
    "Houve muito bate-papo confuso sobre o que essa {i}‘missão secreta’{/i} implicava, e ainda mais a preocupação de agora sermos confrontados pelos Demorai tão claramente despreparados."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1134
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d33077f7:

    # MARKUS "What the fuck was all that about?"
    MARKUS "Que porra foi essa?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1135
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_07f11245:

    # MC "I don’t know, looks like some higher up bullshit to me."
    MC "Não sei, parece alguma besteira de superiores para mim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1136
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3e0ef9c5:

    # MC "Guess we'll be skipping the test then..."
    MC "Acho que vamos pular o teste então..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1137
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_52b2a82f:

    # MARKUS "Hm... I’ll make sure to pack some extra bread for you, okay?"
    MARKUS "Hm... Vou me certificar de embalar um pão extra para você, ok?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1138
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f6d7e7b6:

    # MC "Where’d you get the extra rations from, you fancy fuck?"
    MC "De onde você conseguiu as rações extras, seu fresco de merda?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1139
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a1c732d3:

    # MARKUS "My brother sent it to me the other day, figured we could split it..."
    MARKUS "Meu irmão me mandou outro dia, achei que poderíamos dividir..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1140
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ce4a9c8a:

    # MC "Oh, thank you."
    MC "Oh, obrigado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1141
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7ff3445a:

    # MARKUS "In return I want some of that sweet wine you got!"
    MARKUS "Em troca quero um pouco daquele vinho doce que você tem!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1142
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_95e59f81:

    # MC "What?!"
    MC "O quê?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1143
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_282b2d00:

    # MARKUS "Hey! Don’t hold out on me! I know your dear sweet [regina_ref!t] brought you some!"
    MARKUS "Ei! Não me esconda nada! Eu sei que sua querida e doce [regina_ref!t] lhe trouxe um pouco!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1144
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8b5596df:

    # MC "Alright, alright, {i}we’ll share.{/i}"
    MC "Tudo bem, tudo bem, {i}vamos compartilhar.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1145
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_31c038e0:

    # MARKUS "That’s more like it!"
    MARKUS "Assim está melhor!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1146
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fbd1034e:

    # MARKUS "Didn’t want to have to bust your balls the whole trip if I die of dehydration because you wouldn’t spare {i}‘a single drop’{/i} for your dearest and oldest friend!"
    MARKUS "Não queria ter que te importunar durante toda a viagem se eu morrer de desidratação porque você não quis poupar {i}'uma única gota'{/i} para seu mais querido e velho amigo!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1147
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_9f87cee2:

    # MC "But then how would I achieve my dream of becoming a drunk?"
    MC "Mas então como eu realizaria meu sonho de me tornar um bêbado?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1148
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_957e6607:

    # MARKUS "I have every confidence that you’ll find a way, no matter what."
    MARKUS "Tenho toda confiança de que você encontrará um jeito, não importa o quê."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1150
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a370dbb4:

    # "Suddenly, the ginger haired girl strutted over to us, a coy little smile on her face."
    "De repente, a garota ruiva se aproximou de nós gingando, um sorrisinho tímido no rosto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1151
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d469bfc4:

    # KIARA "Looks like I’ve been partnered up with you two for the march."
    KIARA "Parece que fui escalada com vocês dois para a marcha."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1152
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8cea643d:

    # MARKUS "Oh?"
    MARKUS "Oh?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1153
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_5926d935:

    # KIARA @ happy "Aye, that won’t be a problem, will it?"
    KIARA @ happy "Sim, isso não será um problema, não é?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1154
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f3de8e53:

    # MARKUS "After that little show you put on with the Captain when we first got here? It’ll be our pleasure."
    MARKUS "Depois daquela pequena demonstração que você fez com o Capitão quando chegamos aqui? Será um prazer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1155
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_4e8676e6:

    # MARKUS "I’ll be sure to let you soften the Demorai up before I get there!"
    MARKUS "Farei questão de deixar você amolecer os Demorai antes de eu chegar lá!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1156
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0739d47d:

    # KIARA "How {i}valiant{/i} of you."
    KIARA "Que {i}valente{/i} da sua parte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1158
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_2cba1877:

    # "I caught her gaze and nodded:"
    "Encontrei o olhar dela e acenei:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1159
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ae8a726e:

    # MC "Kiara."
    MC "Kiara."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1160
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_107ca765:

    # "Kiara nodded and smiled mischievously."
    "Kiara assentiu e sorriu maliciosamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1161
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_1b1ca23b:

    # KIARA "What do they call your cute friend here?"
    KIARA "Como chamam o seu amigo fofo aqui?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1162
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_435e4d75:

    # MARKUS "Hey! I can hear you!"
    MARKUS "Ei! Eu consigo te ouvir!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1163
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_217ebd58:

    # KIARA "I know, honey. So?"
    KIARA "Eu sei, querido. E então?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1164
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_65cbbe79:

    # MARKUS "...It's Markus."
    MARKUS "...É o Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1165
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_246faf04:

    # KIARA @ happy "Well then, pleasure to meet you, Markus."
    KIARA @ happy "Bem, então, prazer em conhecê-lo, Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1166
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0757128a:

    # KIARA "I'll take the rear, is that alright with you guys?"
    KIARA "Eu vou na retaguarda, tudo bem para vocês?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1169
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_deaeaf6f:

    # MC "What’s your name?"
    MC "Qual é o seu nome?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1170
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_5e61be4f:

    # KIARA "Kiara, love."
    KIARA "Kiara, amor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1173
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8ae7bf84:

    # "Kiara smiled and winked mischievously."
    "Kiara sorriu e piscou maliciosamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1174
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a0467524:

    # KIARA "What do they call you cuties then?"
    KIARA "E como chamam vocês, fofuras?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1175
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f39a4545:

    # MARKUS "Oooh, did you hear that? She thinks we’re cute!"
    MARKUS "Oooh, você ouviu isso? Ela acha que somos fofos!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1176
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_e8544c91:

    # KIARA "Not when you speak, but I’ve seen worse looking."
    KIARA "Não quando você fala, mas já vi piores."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1177
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d5d404a7:

    # KIARA "Even if you are pale as a ghost!"
    KIARA "Mesmo que você esteja pálido como um fantasma!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1178
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fbeafcd2:

    # MARKUS "Hey!"
    MARKUS "Ei!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1179
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_2c7fdf17:

    # MC "I’m [player_name!t]."
    MC "Eu sou [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1180
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a74d1cac:

    # MARKUS "Markus."
    MARKUS "Marcos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1181
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_e4d4b219:

    # MARKUS @ angry "And I ain’t no ghost!"
    MARKUS @ angry "E eu não sou nenhum fantasma!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1182
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_36300c92:

    # KIARA "Pleasure to meet you both, I’ll take the rear?"
    KIARA "Prazer em conhecê-los, eu fico na retaguarda?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1184
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_35e56202:

    # MC "I don’t see why not."
    MC "Não vejo por que não."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1185
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f81a48ca:

    # KIARA "Thanks, makes a change from you always looking at {i}my{/i} rear."
    KIARA "Obrigado, é uma mudança em relação a você sempre olhando para a {i}minha{/i} bunda."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1186
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_2accebc1:

    # MARKUS "Ha! She’s caught you out good!"
    MARKUS "Ha! Ela te pegou de jeito!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1187
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_4fc8cb2c:

    # MC "I didn’t—"
    MC "Eu não—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1188
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f0011b14:

    # KIARA "I didn’t say I was complaining!"
    KIARA "Eu não disse que estava reclamando!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1189
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3b86159d:

    # KIARA "You can keep admiring all you like, you’re only human after all."
    KIARA "Você pode continuar admirando o quanto quiser, você é apenas humano, afinal."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1190
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_2a91684c:

    # "Markus grinned at me and laughed to himself as he saw how flustered I became."
    "Markus sorriu para mim e riu para si mesmo ao ver como fiquei nervoso."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1191
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_42417170:

    # MC "... Hold on, how come you’ve been told to march with us?"
    MC "... Espera aí, como assim te mandaram marchar com a gente?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1192
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_915dc432:

    # MC "I thought you were going to be further back down the line."
    MC "Achei que você ia ficar mais atrás na linha."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1193
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_65264838:

    # KIARA "I might have asked the commander to move me up next to you two..."
    KIARA "Eu posso ter pedido ao comandante para me colocar ao lado de vocês dois..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1194
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_5a08631f:

    # MC "Why?"
    MC "Por quê?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1195
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3f37e306:

    # MARKUS "Obviously because of my dazzling good looks, [player_name!t]!"
    MARKUS "Obviamente por causa da minha beleza deslumbrante, [player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1196
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_64e215fb:

    # KIARA "Keep lying to yourself if that’s what gets you through the day, love."
    KIARA "Continue mentindo para si mesmo se é isso que te ajuda a passar o dia, amor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1197
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3b54ef92:

    # KIARA "The truth is... everyone’s seen you two fighting."
    KIARA "A verdade é que... todo mundo já viu vocês dois brigando."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1198
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0ac30842:

    # KIARA "You boys make a good team."
    KIARA "Vocês formam uma boa equipe."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1199
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_699eea4a:

    # KIARA "Better than most of this lot at least."
    KIARA "Melhor que a maioria deste pessoal, pelo menos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1200
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_673d1764:

    # KIARA "... Figured I’d stand a better chance of survival being partnered up with you two."
    KIARA "... Pensei que teria mais chances de sobreviver se fosse parceira de vocês dois."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1201
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_48e47706:

    # KIARA "So, I asked, and the Captain agreed to move me up."
    KIARA "Então, eu pedi, e o Capitão concordou em me juntar a vocês."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1202
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_198af0fd:

    # KIARA "Any problems with that?"
    KIARA "Algum problema com isso?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1203
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_04ca229b:

    # "Me and Markus looked at each other."
    "Eu e Markus nos entreolhamos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1204
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_54572fe2:

    # MC "Nope."
    MC "Não."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1205
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_9a84ee75:

    # MARKUS "I’m alright with it."
    MARKUS "Por mim, tudo bem."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1206
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_972b4bb1:

    # KIARA "Good, I’ll see you boys later then..."
    KIARA "Ótimo, então vejo vocês mais tarde..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1210
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0ce8ea7e:

    # "Kiara strutted off, presumably to pack her things for the excursion."
    "Kiara se afastou com confiança, provavelmente para arrumar suas coisas para a excursão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1211
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_b2b7db2b:

    # "Markus smiled ruefully and whistled at me."
    "Markus sorriu com arrependimento e assobiou para mim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1212
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_9d49d3f6:

    # MARKUS "Well... someone’s got a fan!"
    MARKUS "Bem... alguém tem um fã!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1213
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_b3b45f2d:

    # MC "Ha-ha, something tells me that one’s gonna be trouble."
    MC "Ha-ha, algo me diz que essa vai dar problema."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1214
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ceb03dd5:

    # MARKUS "Trouble or not, if you don’t go for her, I sure as hell will!"
    MARKUS "Problema ou não, se você não for atrás dela, com certeza eu vou!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1215
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_cba5c2b3:

    # MC "Hey!"
    MC "Ei!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1216
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_013c78f1:

    # MARKUS "What? If I get a shot at getting laid again before dying, I’m taking it!"
    MARKUS "O quê? Se eu tiver uma chance de transar de novo antes de morrer, eu vou aproveitar!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1217
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_bc14e7e9:

    # MC "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Alright, alright, come on now, let’s get ready for this damn march..."
    MC "{i}*Suspiro*{/i} Tá bom, tá bom, vamos lá, vamos nos preparar para essa maldita marcha..."

